<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cowen starts Depuy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cowen starts Depuy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen said it started Depuy Inc with a strong buy rating and set a 12-month price target of $23.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/8 to 17-7/8 on thin volume Monday morning.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
